# ShopEase – E-Commerce Product Catalog

ShopEase is a full-stack e-commerce product catalog web application developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, Express.js and MongoDB.

## Features

- Responsive e-commerce interface
- Product catalog
- Products loaded from MongoDB
- Search and category filtering
- Shopping cart
- Client-side navigation
- REST API
- Responsive design
- Deployed frontend and backend

## Technologies Used

### Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- REST API

### Database
- MongoDB Atlas

### Deployment
- Vercel
- Render

